Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:40.10,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(528,1)\pos(1068,408)\fnVerdana\fs69\shad0\c&HAB7C4F&\4c&HE0D4DB&\3c&HFEFEFE&\blur6}Aşk Kilidi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.72,0:23:39.36,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Hadi birlikte kilitleyelim.
